SubgroupCount.description_en:
Number of storage sub-placement groups: minimum 2, maximum min{number of available zone clusters, 10}
- If any available zone cluster has fewer clusters than the `SubgroupCount` value, the system returns the error `SubGroupCountExceedClusters` and returns the current number of available zone clusters
- After you set the storage sub-placement groups, the system automatically numbers them in order, starting from 1 up to the total number of storage sub-placement groups
